+set -euo pipefail
+#
+# End-to-end acceptance runner for "fully autonomous" & "fully carbon aware" gates.
+# This script runs:
+#  - wrapper audit & enforcement
+#  - long dry-run & checks
+#  - MTTR drill
+#  - accounting verify (requires a real job_id)
+#  - policy simulation (optional)
+#  - records SME signoff invocation (operator must run actual signoff)
+#
